WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.900
Here’s how to connect your ChatGPT subscription to
your local health control journal.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:11.900
After installation, open your journal and sign in
as its local owner. In the journal, select Model
settings.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.180
In the Provider menu, choose ChatGPT plan. For your
first connection, leave New ChatGPT account
selected.

4
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:25.552
Check the box to allow eligible requests to use
your plan or credits. Then select Continue with
ChatGPT.

5
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:33.900
Your browser opens OpenAI. Sign in there, choose
the account or workspace you want, and review the
permission before approving.

6
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.437
You return to your journal. When you see the plan
confirmation, select Got it.

7
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:46.900
Choose the best available model in the list. Health
control requests its highest advertised reasoning
effort when supported.

8
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:53.900
Select Test connection. It sends a short,
nonclinical request. Wait for the connection
verified message.

9
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.095
Now select Save provider. Your choice applies to
new encounters.

10
00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:05.244
Open New encounter. Check the account and model
shown before you send your history. You’re ready to
begin.
